    {
      "text": "A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it flies, it scatters its flaming scales. It was feared by ancient people, who referred to it as “the rage of the sun.”",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Volcarona scatters burning scales. Some say it does this to start fires. Others say it’s trying to rescue those that suffer in the cold.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon emerges from a cocoon formed of raging flames. Ancient murals depict Volcarona as a deity of fire.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
